      "fontSize": 21.599999999999998,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "1. Exact modifier only - no Ctrl+Shift conflicts\n\n2. Validate the full group - no partial movement\n\n3. One selected object still uses selection actions\n\n4. Paste uses the current z-layer\n\n5. Core batch operations validate before mutation\n\n6. Modifier-click can toggle individual objects\n\n7. Integrated with current mask undo/redo code",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Exact modifier only - no Ctrl+Shift conflicts\n\n2. Validate the full group - no partial movement\n\n3. One selected object still uses selection actions\n\n4. Paste uses the current z-layer\n\n5. Core batch operations validate before mutation\n\n6. Modifier-click can toggle individual objects\n\n7. Integrated with current mask undo/redo code",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
