      "seed": 1043,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2043,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "PHASE 1 - CORE BEHAVIOR\n\nMOVE\nApply one geometry delta to\nevery selected object.\n\nDELETE\nDelete all targets. Shift+Delete\nforce-deletes locked objects.\n\nCOPY\nSerialize selected objects without\nretaining live state references.\n\nPASTE\nRecreate objects on the current\nlayer and preserve relative geometry.\n\nUNDO / REDO\nTreat move, delete, and paste as\none history action each.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PHASE 1 - CORE BEHAVIOR\n\nMOVE\nApply one geometry delta to\nevery selected object.\n\nDELETE\nDelete all targets. Shift+Delete\nforce-deletes locked objects.\n\nCOPY\nSerialize selected objects without\nretaining live state references.\n\nPASTE\nRecreate objects on the current\nlayer and preserve relative geometry.\n\nUNDO / REDO\nTreat move, delete, and paste as\none history action each.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "operations-phase-2-box",
