      "seed": 1045,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2045,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "PHASE 2 - EXTENDED COMMANDS\n\nCHANGE LABEL\nValidate the target label against\nevery selected shape.\n\nGROUP / UNGROUP\nConsume the persistent selection\ndirectly.\n\nJOIN\nValidate label, object type, and\nshape-type compatibility.\n\nLOCK / OCCLUDED\nApply one explicit value to the\ncomplete selection.\n\nZ-ORDER\nMove selected objects together\nwithout changing relative order.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PHASE 2 - EXTENDED COMMANDS\n\nCHANGE LABEL\nValidate the target label against\nevery selected shape.\n\nGROUP / UNGROUP\nConsume the persistent selection\ndirectly.\n\nJOIN\nValidate label, object type, and\nshape-type compatibility.\n\nLOCK / OCCLUDED\nApply one explicit value to the\ncomplete selection.\n\nZ-ORDER\nMove selected objects together\nwithout changing relative order.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "operations-phase-3-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1335,
      "y": 2740,
