      "fontSize": 30,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "7. HLD context, alternatives, and delivery assumptions",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "7. HLD context, alternatives, and delivery assumptions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-problem-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 3980,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaG",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1053,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-problem-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 145,
      "y": 4020,
      "width": 680,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1054,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2054,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "INITIAL PROBLEM\n\nCVAT actions are primarily designed\naround one activated object. Users cannot\npersistently select several canvas objects\nand safely operate on them as one unit.\n\nThis makes repeated movement, deletion,\ncopying, grouping, and property changes\nslow and error-prone. Repeating existing\nsingle-object commands also produces\nmultiple history entries and partial results.\n\nGOAL\nIntroduce a persistent selected set and a\nsafe command model without changing the\nsemantics of unrelated annotation tools.\n\nNON-GOAL\nSupporting every object operation in the\nfirst delivery.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "INITIAL PROBLEM\n\nCVAT actions are primarily designed\naround one activated object. Users cannot\npersistently select several canvas objects\nand safely operate on them as one unit.\n\nThis makes repeated movement, deletion,\ncopying, grouping, and property changes\nslow and error-prone. Repeating existing\nsingle-object commands also produces\nmultiple history entries and partial results.\n\nGOAL\nIntroduce a persistent selected set and a\nsafe command model without changing the\nsemantics of unrelated annotation tools.\n\nNON-GOAL\nSupporting every object operation in the\nfirst delivery.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-options-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 3980,
      "width": 750,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff4e6",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaI",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1055,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2055,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-options-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 940,
      "y": 4020,
      "width": 670,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaJ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1056,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2056,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "SOLUTION OPTIONS\n\nA. UI loops over existing commands\n+ Smaller initial change\n- Partial failures and many history entries\n- Business rules duplicated in UI\n\nB. Persistent selection + Core batch API\n+ One source of truth\n+ Atomic commands and one history entry\n+ Reusable capability validation\n- Requires Canvas, UI, and Core changes\n\nC. Canvas owns selection and mutations\n+ Direct interaction implementation\n- Couples rendering to annotation rules\n- Harder to reuse outside 2D canvas\n\nDECISION\nChoose B. It preserves module ownership and\nprovides the safest base for later commands.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "SOLUTION OPTIONS\n\nA. UI loops over existing commands\n+ Smaller initial change\n- Partial failures and many history entries\n- Business rules duplicated in UI\n\nB. Persistent selection + Core batch API\n+ One source of truth\n+ Atomic commands and one history entry\n+ Reusable capability validation\n- Requires Canvas, UI, and Core changes\n\nC. Canvas owns selection and mutations\n+ Direct interaction implementation\n- Couples rendering to annotation rules\n- Harder to reuse outside 2D canvas\n\nDECISION\nChoose B. It preserves module ownership and\nprovides the safest base for later commands.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-concepts-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1685,
      "y": 3980,
      "width": 825,
      "height": 800,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#7048e8",
      "backgroundColor": "#e5dbff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaK",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 1057,
