    },
    {
      "id": "hld-concepts-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1725,
      "y": 4020,
      "width": 745,
      "height": 720,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aaL",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1058,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2058,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1786350000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "NEW AND CHANGED CONCEPTS\n\nPersistent selection\nRedux stores client IDs independently from\nthe temporarily activated or hovered object.\n\nPrimary interaction target\nDragging one selected object represents an\noperation on the complete selected set.\n\nBatch command boundary\nCore validates and mutates all targets under\none Undo/Redo history item.\n\nCapability validation\nEach operation defines compatible object\ntypes, shape types, lock state, and labels.\n\nSelection lifecycle\nFrame changes, deletion, and stale IDs must\nclear or reconcile the selected set.\n\nCurrent-layer paste\nNew copies use the selected layer while\npreserving relative geometry.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "NEW AND CHANGED CONCEPTS\n\nPersistent selection\nRedux stores client IDs independently from\nthe temporarily activated or hovered object.\n\nPrimary interaction target\nDragging one selected object represents an\noperation on the complete selected set.\n\nBatch command boundary\nCore validates and mutates all targets under\none Undo/Redo history item.\n\nCapability validation\nEach operation defines compatible object\ntypes, shape types, lock state, and labels.\n\nSelection lifecycle\nFrame changes, deletion, and stale IDs must\nclear or reconcile the selected set.\n\nCurrent-layer paste\nNew copies use the selected layer while\npreserving relative geometry.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
    {
      "id": "hld-corners-box",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 105,
      "y": 4860,
      "width": 1545,
      "height": 1080,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff5f5",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
